  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 299f02cab8b437643be53cf2058c1adf, type: 3}
  m_Name: VR Yoga
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  projectName: VR Yoga
  description: "A VR prototype exploring how games can teach real physical skills
    \u2014 in this case, basic standing yoga poses. Inspired by Beat Saber's movement
    mechanics, the game guides players into correct positions by having them intercept
    incoming objects, then hold the pose statically for 30 seconds. Soothing music
    rewards correct form, tying the auditory feedback directly to the physical experience.\n\nThree
    moves, simple rules, and a genuinely interesting design question: can a game
    make you do yoga without it feeling like exercise?\nITU Project"
